<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 27.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 27.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seorax 54/55,000 tonnes hss Nopac/SKorea mid-Dec $14.65 10,000/7,250 and 6,500 Andre.</p>
<p>TBN 30,000 tonnes hss Baie Comeau/Lisbon 9-18/12$10.50 6,000/10,000 Cargill.</p>
<p>TBN 18,000 tonnes grains USG/Guayaquil 5-12/12 $26.00 five days/4,000 Cargill.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
